{"real": false, "dur": 71.98, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 6.94, "text": "Let me take one situation from start to finish, so you can see how it all fits.", "words": [{"w": "Let", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "me", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "take", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "one", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "situation", "s": 1.94}, {"w": "from", "s": 2.32}, {"w": "start", "s": 2.71}, {"w": "to", "s": 3.09}, {"w": "finish,", "s": 3.48}, {"w": "so", "s": 3.86}, {"w": "you", "s": 4.25}, {"w": "can", "s": 4.63}, {"w": "see", "s": 5.02}, {"w": "how", "s": 5.4}, {"w": "it", "s": 5.78}, {"w": "all", "s": 6.17}, {"w": "fits.", "s": 6.55}]}, {"start": 7.29, "end": 8.44, "text": "French Unit 2.", "words": [{"w": "French", "s": 7.29}, {"w": "Unit", "s": 7.67}, {"w": "2.", "s": 8.06}]}, {"start": 8.79, "end": 11.48, "text": "The situation is saying what you like.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 8.79}, {"w": "situation", "s": 9.18}, {"w": "is", "s": 9.56}, {"w": "saying", "s": 9.95}, {"w": "what", "s": 10.33}, {"w": "you", "s": 10.72}, {"w": "like.", "s": 11.1}]}, {"start": 11.83, "end": 14.53, "text": "You can see the French title here.", "words": [{"w": "You", "s": 11.83}, {"w": "can", "s": 12.22}, {"w": "see", "s": 12.6}, {"w": "the", "s": 12.99}, {"w": "French", "s": 13.37}, {"w": "title", "s": 13.76}, {"w": "here.", "s": 14.14}]}, {"start": 14.88, "end": 21.03, "text": "First, learners work through the linguistic goals using the three-star progression and Bonus you’ve just seen.", "words": [{"w": "First,", "s": 14.88}, {"w": "learners", "s": 15.26}, {"w": "work", "s": 15.65}, {"w": "through", "s": 16.03}, {"w": "the", "s": 16.42}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 16.8}, {"w": "goals", "s": 17.18}, {"w": "using", "s": 17.57}, {"w": "the", "s": 17.95}, {"w": "three-star", "s": 18.34}, {"w": "progression", "s": 18.72}, {"w": "and", "s": 19.11}, {"w": "Bonus", "s": 19.49}, {"w": "you’ve", "s": 19.88}, {"w": "just", "s": 20.26}, {"w": "seen.", "s": 20.65}]}, {"start": 21.38, "end": 25.61, "text": "On the left is the exercise tab from my original page.", "words": [{"w": "On", "s": 21.38}, {"w": "the", "s": 21.77}, {"w": "left", "s": 22.15}, {"w": "is", "s": 22.53}, {"w": "the", "s": 22.92}, {"w": "exercise", "s": 23.3}, {"w": "tab", "s": 23.69}, {"w": "from", "s": 24.07}, {"w": "my", "s": 24.46}, {"w": "original", "s": 24.84}, {"w": "page.", "s": 25.23}]}, {"start": 25.96, "end": 29.42, "text": "Then learners practise the situation in four different ways.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "s": 25.96}, {"w": "learners", "s": 26.35}, {"w": "practise", "s": 26.73}, {"w": "the", "s": 27.12}, {"w": "situation", "s": 27.5}, {"w": "in", "s": 27.88}, {"w": "four", "s": 28.27}, {"w": "different", "s": 28.65}, {"w": "ways.", "s": 29.04}]}, {"start": 29.77, "end": 32.08, "text": "In ÉcouTexte, they listen to it.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 29.77}, {"w": "ÉcouTexte,", "s": 30.16}, {"w": "they", "s": 30.54}, {"w": "listen", "s": 30.93}, {"w": "to", "s": 31.31}, {"w": "it.", "s": 31.7}]}, {"start": 32.43, "end": 43.58, "text": "In G-Compris, which means “I understood,” they read a short everyday document, like the message on the right, and answer questions that check what the course has actually taught.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 32.43}, {"w": "G-Compris,", "s": 32.82}, {"w": "which", "s": 33.2}, {"w": "means", "s": 33.58}, {"w": "“I", "s": 33.97}, {"w": "understood,”", "s": 34.35}, {"w": "they", "s": 34.74}, {"w": "read", "s": 35.12}, {"w": "a", "s": 35.51}, {"w": "short", "s": 35.89}, {"w": "everyday", "s": 36.28}, {"w": "document,", "s": 36.66}, {"w": "like", "s": 37.05}, {"w": "the", "s": 37.43}, {"w": "message", "s": 37.82}, {"w": "on", "s": 38.2}, {"w": "the", "s": 38.58}, {"w": "right,", "s": 38.97}, {"w": "and", "s": 39.35}, {"w": "answer", "s": 39.74}, {"w": "questions", "s": 40.12}, {"w": "that", "s": 40.51}, {"w": "check", "s": 40.89}, {"w": "what", "s": 41.28}, {"w": "the", "s": 41.66}, {"w": "course", "s": 42.05}, {"w": "has", "s": 42.43}, {"w": "actually", "s": 42.82}, {"w": "taught.", "s": 43.2}]}, {"start": 43.93, "end": 47.01, "text": "Spotting a matching word won’t get you through.", "words": [{"w": "Spotting", "s": 43.93}, {"w": "a", "s": 44.32}, {"w": "matching", "s": 44.7}, {"w": "word", "s": 45.09}, {"w": "won’t", "s": 45.47}, {"w": "get", "s": 45.86}, {"w": "you", "s": 46.24}, {"w": "through.", "s": 46.63}]}, {"start": 47.36, "end": 50.05, "text": "In WorDrill, they say it out loud.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 47.36}, {"w": "WorDrill,", "s": 47.75}, {"w": "they", "s": 48.13}, {"w": "say", "s": 48.52}, {"w": "it", "s": 48.9}, {"w": "out", "s": 49.28}, {"w": "loud.", "s": 49.67}]}, {"start": 50.4, "end": 55.4, "text": "In ComposeIt, they write a few lines of their own and get feedback.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 50.4}, {"w": "ComposeIt,", "s": 50.79}, {"w": "they", "s": 51.17}, {"w": "write", "s": 51.56}, {"w": "a", "s": 51.94}, {"w": "few", "s": 52.33}, {"w": "lines", "s": 52.71}, {"w": "of", "s": 53.1}, {"w": "their", "s": 53.48}, {"w": "own", "s": 53.87}, {"w": "and", "s": 54.25}, {"w": "get", "s": 54.63}, {"w": "feedback.", "s": 55.02}]}, {"start": 55.75, "end": 61.52, "text": "And at the end of the unit, there’s the Mission: planning a weekend outing together.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 55.75}, {"w": "at", "s": 56.14}, {"w": "the", "s": 56.52}, {"w": "end", "s": 56.91}, {"w": "of", "s": 57.29}, {"w": "the", "s": 57.68}, {"w": "unit,", "s": 58.06}, {"w": "there’s", "s": 58.45}, {"w": "the", "s": 58.83}, {"w": "Mission:", "s": 59.22}, {"w": "planning", "s": 59.6}, {"w": "a", "s": 59.98}, {"w": "weekend", "s": 60.37}, {"w": "outing", "s": 60.75}, {"w": "together.", "s": 61.14}]}, {"start": 61.87, "end": 64.57, "text": "It uses every situation in the unit.", "words": [{"w": "It", "s": 61.87}, {"w": "uses", "s": 62.26}, {"w": "every", "s": 62.64}, {"w": "situation", "s": 63.03}, {"w": "in", "s": 63.41}, {"w": "the", "s": 63.8}, {"w": "unit.", "s": 64.18}]}, {"start": 64.92, "end": 68.38, "text": "On the map, learners see each step in order.", "words": [{"w": "On", "s": 64.92}, {"w": "the", "s": 65.3}, {"w": "map,", "s": 65.68}, {"w": "learners", "s": 66.07}, {"w": "see", "s": 66.45}, {"w": "each", "s": 66.84}, {"w": "step", "s": 67.22}, {"w": "in", "s": 67.61}, {"w": "order.", "s": 67.99}]}, {"start": 68.73, "end": 71.03, "text": "Everything follows the same learning path.", "words": [{"w": "Everything", "s": 68.73}, {"w": "follows", "s": 69.11}, {"w": "the", "s": 69.5}, {"w": "same", "s": 69.88}, {"w": "learning", "s": 70.27}, {"w": "path.", "s": 70.65}]}]}